{"query":"reulDonaldTrump tweet \"THE NEXT 30 TO 60 DAYS WILL BE THE BIGGEST DRAINING OF THE SWAMP EVER\" archive","results":[{"position":1,"site_name":"dailycaller.com","snippet":"# FACT CHECK: Did Trump Tweet That ‘The Next 30 To 60 Days Will Be The Biggest Draining Of The Swamp Ever’?\nFont Size:\n\nAn image shared on Facebook purportedly shows a tweet from President Donald Trump that reads, “The next 30 to 60 days will be the biggest draining of the swamp ever!”\n\n**Verdict: False** There is no record of Trump tweeting or deleting the statement. The tweet appears to come from a hoax account. The tweet, which was screen grabbed and posted on Facebook, masquerades as a statement from Trump, saying, “The next 30 to 60 days will be the biggest draining of the swamp ever! Enough is enough, the time has arrived!” It has been shared on QAnon pages and appears to reference Trump’s campaign promise to curb corruption in Washington. There is, however, no record of Trump tweeting the statement from his @realDonaldTrump and @POTUS Twitter accounts. Nor does it appear in ProPublica’s archive of his deleted tweets on Sept. 4 or any other date. A closer inspection of the alleged tweets shows that it actually comes from a hoax account unaffiliated with the president. The Twitter account lacks the blue verification check mark and has a slightly different handle – @reuIDonaldTrump rather than @realDonaldTrump. It appears to have since been deleted. Politicians are often the targets of hoax Twitter accounts that social media users share as if they are genuine. Check Your Fact has previously debunked statements from accounts masquerading as British Prime Minister Boris Johnson and Democratic Michigan Rep.","title":"FACT CHECK: Did Trump Tweet That ‘The Next 30 To 60 Days Will Be The Biggest Draining Of The Swamp Ever’?","url":"https://dailycaller.com/2020/09/14/fact-check-donald-trump-draining-swamp-tweet/"},{"position":2,"site_name":"checkyourfact.com","snippet":"# FACT CHECK: Did Trump Tweet That ‘The Next 30 To 60 Days Will Be The Biggest Draining Of The Swamp Ever’?\n**Verdict: False**","title":"FACT CHECK: Did Trump Tweet That ‘The Next 30 To 60 Days Will Be The Biggest Draining Of The Swamp Ever’?","url":"https://checkyourfact.com/2020/09/14/fact-check-donald-trump-draining-swamp-tweet/"},{"position":3,"site_name":"factcheck.afp.com","snippet":"# The image is a screenshot of a tweet posted by a hoax Donald Trump account.\nAn image showing a purported tweet from Donald Trump reading “THE NEXT 30 TO 60 DAYS WILL BE THE BIGGEST DRAINING OF THE SWAMP EVER” has been shared hundreds of times on Facebook. The claim was posted to Facebook by a New Zealand-based user here. The post have been shared over 200 times.\n\nA screenshot of the misleading image, taken September 8, 2020. The tweet reads: “THE NEXT 30 TO 60 DAYS WILL BE THE BIGGEST DRAINING OF THE SWAMP EVER! ENOUGH IS ENOUGH, THE TIME HAS ARRIVED!”\n\nThe Facebook post’s caption reads: “deleted as quick as he posted it #WWG1WGA”.\n\nThe image, however, is misleading. The screenshot comes from this hoax Twitter account purporting to be Donald Trump.","title":"The image is a screenshot of a tweet posted by a hoax Donald Trump account.","url":"https://factcheck.afp.com/image-screenshot-tweet-posted-hoax-donald-trump-account"},{"position":4,"site_name":"www.boomlive.in","snippet":"# Fake Donald Trump Account Promises To \"Drain The Swamp\" In 60 Days\nFake Donald Trump Account Promises To Drain The Swamp In 60 Days An image showing a purported tweet from Donald Trump reading \"THE NEXT 30 TO 60 DAYS WILL BE THE BIGGEST DRAINING OF THE SWAMP EVER\" has been shared hundreds of times on Facebook. The image is misleading; the image shows a screenshot of a hoax account purporting to be the US president.\n\nThe claim was posted to Facebook by a New Zealand-based user here. The post have been shared over 200 times. A screenshot of the misleading image, taken September 8, 2020.\n\nThe image features a screenshot of what appears to be a tweet from the US President Donald Trump.\n\nThe tweet reads: \"THE NEXT 30 TO 60 DAYS WILL BE THE BIGGEST DRAINING OF THE SWAMP EVER! ENOUGH IS ENOUGH, THE TIME HAS ARRIVED!\" The Facebook post's caption reads: \"deleted as quick as he posted it #WWG1WGA\".\n\nA similar image was also shared hundreds of times here, here and here.\n\nThe image, however, is misleading.\n\nThe screenshot comes from this hoax Twitter account purporting to be Donald Trump. The original tweet can be seen here. The image clearly shows the handle of the account where the tweet originated from as @reulDonaldTrump, while the actual Twitter handle of the US president is @realDonaldTrump.\n\nTrump's tweets are also accompanied by a blue tick after his username, which means Twitter has verified the account.\n\nThe tweet featured in the widely shared misleading screenshot doesn't include the blue tick after the username, rather in the profile's photo. See below a comparison of the hoax Twitter account (L) and real Twitter account for the US president (R):\n\nA screenshot of the hoax account purporting to be Donald Trump (left) and Donald Trump's real Twitter account (right).\n\nThe caption WWG1WA is a reference to the widely debunked conspiracy theory QANON, which AFP has reported was recently removed from Facebook for its ties to violence. ## Tags\nClaim :   Donald Trump tweeted that the \\\"next 30-60 days will see the biggest draining of the swamp ever\\\".\n\nClaimed By :  Facebook posts\n\nFact Check :  False {\"claimReviewed\":\"Donald Trump tweeted that the \\\"next 30-60 days will see the biggest draining of the swamp ever\\\".\",\"reviewRating\":{\"alternateName\":\"False\"}} {\"name\":\"BOOM\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"BOOM\"},\"keywords\":\"US Elections 2020, Joe Biden, Donald Trump, Kamala Harris, Mike Pence, US Elections, Drain The Swamp, 2020 US Elections, 2020 US Presidential Elections, US Presidential Elections, American Elections, Democrats, Republicans\",\"interactivityType\":\"mixed\",\"inLanguage\":\"\",\"headline\":\"Fake Donald Trump Account Promises To \\\"Drain The Swamp\\\" In 60 Days | BOOM\",\"copyrightHolder\":\"BOOM\",\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"BOOM\"}}","title":"Fake Donald Trump Account Promises To \"Drain The Swamp\" In 60 Days","url":"https://www.boomlive.in/world/fake-donald-trump-account-promises-to-drain-the-swamp-in-60-days-9680"},{"position":5,"site_name":"m.dailyhunt.in","snippet":"Boom FactCheck\n\nFake Donald Trump Account Promises To \"Drain The Swamp\" In 60 Days ## Fake Donald Trump Account Promises To \"Drain The Swamp\" In 60 Days\nAn image showing a purported tweet from Donald Trump reading \"THE NEXT 30 TO 60 DAYS WILL BE THE BIGGEST DRAINING OF THE SWAMP EVER\" has been shared hundreds of times on Facebook. The image is misleading; the image shows a screenshot of a hoax account purporting to be the US president. The claim was posted to Facebook by a New Zealand-based user here. The post have been shared over 200 times.\n\nA screenshot of the misleading image, taken September 8, 2020.","title":"Fake Donald Trump Account Promises To","url":"https://m.dailyhunt.in/news/india/english/boom+factcheck-epaper-boomfe/fake+donald+trump+account+promises+to+drain+the+swamp+in+60+days-newsid-n213627416"}],"total_results":5,"page":0}